  "message_id": "MSG_000",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞美食广场……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e810_830.bf.json:0:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_000",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞女生们还一个都没出现……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e810_830.bf.json:1:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_001",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 A4 0E}{F5 C1 04 01 01 01 01 01 03 01}神秘庆典中突然出现的，\n神秘超新星男孩。\n他将带来谜团，还是风暴……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e810_830.bf.json:1:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_001",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 C1 02 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 C1 04 01 01 01 01 01 03 01}由谜团与谜团构成的神秘男子！\n其名便是，Ｘ先生！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e810_830.bf.json:2:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_002",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 21 01 03 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 B4 11}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 08 01}锵锵锵！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e810_830.bf.json:3:0",
  "message_id": "SEL_003",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 01 01 02 01 01 01 04 01}一开始就知道了{F5 47 02 01 01 01 01 01 21 01}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e810_830.bf.json:3:1",
  "message_id": "SEL_003",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}原来是你……！{F5 47 02 01 01 01 01 01 21 01}{00}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e810_830.bf.json:4:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_004",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0A 01 0B 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 02 07}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}真、真的吗熊！？\n明明在保健室的笔记上\n彻底隐藏了身份……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e810_830.bf.json:4:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_004",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 94 07}看来瞒不过老师的眼睛熊……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e810_830.bf.json:5:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_005",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0A 01 0D 01 03 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 2B 07}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 08 01}哼哼。\n老师真迟钝呢。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e810_830.bf.json:5:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_005",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}不过嘛，在保健室的笔记上\n已经把身份藏得彻彻底底，\n没发现也很正常。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e810_830.bf.json:6:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_006",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0A 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 22 07}熊制定了一个计划哦。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e810_830.bf.json:6:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_006",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}老师一邀请，大家就会来吧？\n然后大家一起开茶会，对吧？？\n再然后，熊中途离开一下。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e810_830.bf.json:6:2",
  "message_id": "MSG_006",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0A 01 03 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 3A 07}接着，惊喜登场！\n披上这件斗篷、戴上这副墨镜，\nＸ先生闪亮登场熊！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e810_830.bf.json:7:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_007",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞小熊展示的是\n　保健室的窗帘和假鼻子眼镜……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e810_830.bf.json:8:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_008",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0A 01 0D 01 03 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 2B 07}变成Ｘ先生的熊，\n凭借神秘感让好感度上升！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e810_830.bf.json:8:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_008",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}等大家期待到顶点，再揭晓身份，\nＸ先生的好感度就会\n全部变成熊的熊！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e810_830.bf.json:8:2",
  "message_id": "MSG_008",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 E8 06}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 08 01}多么完美的计划！\n怎么样？熊厉害吧？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e810_830.bf.json:9:0",
  "message_id": "SEL_009",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 01 01 02 01 01 01 04 01}马上就会被识破{F5 47 02 01 01 01 01 01 21 01}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e810_830.bf.json:9:1",
  "message_id": "SEL_009",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}厉害厉害{F5 47 02 01 01 01 01 01 21 01}{00}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e810_830.bf.json:10:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_010",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 C1 1A 01 01 01 01 01 03 01}{F5 86 0A 01 0B 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 02 07}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}咦，会被识破！？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e810_830.bf.json:10:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_010",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e810_830.bf.json:10:2",
  "message_id": "MSG_010",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0A 01 03 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 07 07}嗯，算了。\n能开茶会也挺好的。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e810_830.bf.json:11:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_011",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0A 01 03 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 22 07}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 08 01}是吧是吧！？\n老师真懂熊。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e810_830.bf.json:12:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_012",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 86 07}{F5 C1 04 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}那么那么！\n来吧，月光馆的女生们！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e810_830.bf.json:13:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_013",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞小熊兴致高昂……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e810_830.bf.json:13:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_013",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞和小熊一起等大家来吧……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 }
